ic","site_admin":false},"body":"Proves the unchanged TR-26 isotropic reduced-degree statement for every d ≥ 2, using the actual raw isotropic image and a squarefree homogeneous polynomial of degree 2d. The nonisotropic endpoint and full Target remain unproved; TR-26 retains its canonical README, original target, ID, and Solved status.\n\nThe canonical partial package selects one genuine theorem, NLA.Proofs.TR26.isotropic_degree, with LeanCert kernel mode and only the three standard Lean axioms. It preserves the frozen original statements, two independent exact-source reviews, 36 exact shared Lean copies, and 353 hash-locked inputs. Fresh author macOS replay checks 40 runtime Lean sources and three actual negative controls. Independent canonical-package review and genuine Linux/Comparator receipts are pending and will be added with their exact source bindings.\n\nAdditional nonisotropic support modules are explicitly support-only. Mathematical source credit remains with Matthew J. Colbrook; agents supplied formal implementation and review. Stacked on the sealed IE-22 proof branch.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:50:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:54:05Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f05ce3131294a29e3473e5b539f56d8221b82326","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ajt60gaibb:codex/tr26-exact-degree-oct26","ref":"codex/tr26-exact-degree-oct26","repo":{"id":1360959635,"node_id":"R_kgDOUR6Ykw","name":"OpenProblemsInNLA","full_name":"ajt60gaibb/OpenProblemsInNLA","owner":{"login":"ajt60gaibb","id":1814063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTQwNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1814063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajt60gaibb","html_url":"https://github.com/ajt60gaibb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajt60gaibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajt60gaibb/following{